From 8e2a96ee580eed6b78b423ba28a548153f62ce6e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:12:35 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Say in the album detail whether the album has releases to
 choose between

Android counted the album's releases to decide whether to draw the
release chips, and Android Auto flattened each release's track groups
that the release already lists flat. The album detail now carries the
count's answer as a column, and Android Auto reads the release's own
track list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
